{
 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.047,
   "end": 3.506,
   "text": "Hour 22. One Iskander-M,"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.506,
   "end": 5.259,
   "text": "with a nuclear warhead,"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.259,
   "end": 6.818,
   "text": "leaves Kaliningrad for the"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.818,
   "end": 8.408,
   "text": "open Baltic Sea."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.667,
   "end": 9.778,
   "text": "No ship and no"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.778,
   "end": 11.248,
   "text": "coast is the target."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.528,
   "end": 13.143,
   "text": "It is a warning shot,"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.143,
   "end": 14.648,
   "text": "and it is our choice."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.9,
   "end": 17.318,
   "text": "One reading of Russian signalling holds"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.318,
   "end": 19.528,
   "text": "that such a shot is possible."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.752,
   "end": 20.698,
   "text": "We do not claim"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.698,
   "end": 22.408,
   "text": "it is Russian policy."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.195,
   "end": 25.348,
   "text": "The Iskander is dual-capable:"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.504,
   "end": 26.438,
   "text": "it can carry either"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.438,
   "end": 27.648,
   "text": "kind of warhead."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.059,
   "end": 28.618,
   "text": "The flight is"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.618,
   "end": 30.638,
   "text": "234 km,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.638,
   "end": 32.248,
   "text": "about three and a half minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.49,
   "end": 35.708,
   "text": "No open source gives its yield."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.958,
   "end": 37.218,
   "text": "So in this simulation,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.218,
   "end": 39.071,
   "text": "we use 10 kilotons,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.071,
   "end": 40.748,
   "text": "about half of Nagasaki."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.026,
   "end": 42.606,
   "text": "What does 10 kilotons do,"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.606,
   "end": 43.568,
   "text": "over water?"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.04,
   "end": 46.698,
   "text": "The warhead bursts in the"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.698,
   "end": 48.168,
   "text": "air above the sea,"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.34,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "well over"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.858,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "100 km from"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.218,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "any coast."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.565,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "Every number in this chapter"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.918,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "comes from our engine,"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.726,
   "end": 48.188,
   "text": "and every one is an estimate."
  }
